      *****************************************************************
      **  COBOL COPY MBR FOR ARIBA CATALOG FILE    -  MCFPARBCAT
      *****************************************************************
       01  BUF-DARIBEXP.
           03  ARIBAEXP-REQ-NUMBER      PIC X(12)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-CORP-CODE       PIC X(10)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-PLANT-ID        PIC X(04)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-USER-ID         PIC X(08)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-REQ-QTY         PIC S9(08)V9999 VALUE +0.
           03  ARIBAEXP-REQ-QTY-UM      PIC X(02)     VALUE SPACE.
      *=================================
      ** PREFERRED ITEM FIELDS
      *=================================
           03  ARIBAEXP-PRF-MANUFACT-NAME   PIC X(50) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-PRF-MANUFACT-PARTNO PIC X(50) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-PRF-VENDOR-CODE     PIC X(10) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-PRF-VENDOR-PARTNO   PIC X(50) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-PRF-VENDOR-AUXID    PIC X(50) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-PRF-VENDOR-PRICE  PIC S9(11)V9999 COMP-3.
           03  ARIBAEXP-PRF-CURR-CODE   PIC X(02)     VALUE SPACE.
      *=================================
      ** EXCEPTION ITEM FIELDS
      *=================================
           03  ARIBAEXP-EXP-MANUFACT-NAME   PIC X(50) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-EXP-MANUFACT-PARTNO PIC X(50) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-EXP-VENDOR-CODE     PIC X(10) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-EXP-VENDOR-PARTNO   PIC X(50) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-EXP-VENDOR-AUXID    PIC X(50) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-EXP-PURCH-PRICE   PIC S9(11)V9999 COMP-3.
           03  ARIBAEXP-EXP-CURR-CODE   PIC X(02)     VALUE SPACE.
      *=================================
      ** MISC DATA ITEMS
      *=================================
           03  ARIBAEXP-QTY-ORD         PIC S9(08)V9999 VALUE +0.
           03  ARIBAEXP-REASON-CODE     PIC X(04) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-REASON-TEXT     PIC X(80) VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBAEXP-DATE-TIME       PIC X(14) VALUE SPACE.
